# The repo-root .gitignore excludes *.json, *.csv and config.yaml globally (they
# are normally large data artefacts). The three files below are SOURCE, not data
# -- the module cannot run without them -- so re-include them here.
# This file is scoped to code/llm_study/ and changes nothing elsewhere.
!config.yaml
!categories.json
!prompts/manifest.csv
